    "title": "Link compatible predicates or clauses with 而",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-connectors-p02-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Link compatible predicates or clauses with 而",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Connect compatible descriptive predicates or parallel clauses. This is not a general replacement for the connector between ordinary nouns. 而 can contrast two full parallel clauses, not only link descriptive adjectives.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这个房间小而漂亮。",
                "pinyin": "zhège fángjiān xiǎo ér piàoliang 。",
                "meaning": "This room is small and attractive.",
                "audio": "a539091afb9793f5e681fbfd8b50745a6d53e156d08864107e87f28174b6fabb"
              },
              {
                "text": "他喜欢茶，而我喜欢咖啡。",
                "pinyin": "tā xǐhuan chá ， ér wǒ xǐhuan kāfēi 。",
                "meaning": "He likes tea, whereas I like coffee.",
                "audio": "d143bed8d0e71bc924e7978f419d6240e1356297796c291ee4fcfc02a751ca10"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
